{"id":"664549","name":"红糖糍粑","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664549/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"珍珠","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米粉加入温水。","img":"images/664549/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"揉成面团备用。","img":"images/664549/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红糖珍珠备用。","img":"images/664549/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中水开放入珍珠。","img":"images/664549/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"中火将珍珠煮5分钟左右。","img":"images/664549/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"糯米面团分别搓成小圆球后按扁。","img":"images/664549/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"平底锅适量花生油，把糍粑下锅。","img":"images/664549/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小火把两面都煎一遍，煎好后夹出。","img":"images/664549/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中放入红糖，加入适量清水。","img":"images/664549/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开融化。","img":"images/664549/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入珍珠。","img":"images/664549/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入煎过的糍粑。","img":"images/664549/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"中小火将糍粑煮断生入味收汁即可。","img":"images/664549/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664549/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664549/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664549/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}